From 0fffdc7b6625135d487bcda28b6c2dae1533ece6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eriri CI <eriri-ci@localhost>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 05:46:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] eriri-sdk: build a single module holding every plugin (E007)

Mapping a plugin dylib for the first time is what the kernel spends its
embedded code signature validation on, and that cost is per file rather than
per byte: 0.14-0.58 s for each newly created plugin file, 2-3 ms once it is
warm. A playback closure is 50-80 plugins, so the first playback after an SDK
swap takes tens of seconds, and it happens again whenever the system purges its
validation cache. The file count is the only lever that moves it.

This builds one libvlc_plugins.dylib out of the same partially-linked objects a
fully static build uses, and has libvlccore register its modules directly
instead of mapping one file per plugin. The plugins are still built, installed
and scanned exactly as before, so the change is additive: without the bank, or
if it cannot be loaded, everything behaves as it does today.

In a dynamic build each plugin exports the unsuffixed vlc_entry, so the
partially-linked object has no vlc_entry__<module> symbol for the static module
table to refer to. Alias it to a name derived from the plugin path, and make
the symbollist and the manifest agree on that name.

  configure.ac        --enable-plugin-bank, and HAVE_STATIC_PLUGINS so that
                      bin/vlc keeps linking the static module table only in a
                      static build
  bin/Makefile.am     gate that on HAVE_STATIC_PLUGINS
  modules/static.mk   alias the entry, build and install the bank
  src/modules/bank.c  load the bank when it is there, skip the plugin scan
  eriri/vlc.conf      turn the bank on for the macOS SDK
---
 .vscode/c_cpp_properties.json |  16 +++++
 bin/Makefile.am               |   2 +-
 configure.ac                  |  25 ++++++++
 eriri/vlc.conf                |   7 +++
 modules/static.mk             |  95 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/modules/bank.c            | 111 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 6 files changed, 244 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 .vscode/c_cpp_properties.json

diff --git a/.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json b/.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..100f60972b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json
@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+{
+    "configurations": [
+        {
+            "name": "Mac",
+            "includePath": [
+                "${workspaceFolder}/**"
+            ],
+            "defines": [],
+            "compilerPath": "/usr/bin/clang",
+            "cStandard": "c17",
+            "cppStandard": "c++14",
+            "intelliSenseMode": "macos-clang-arm64"
